{
  "info": {
    "name": "KSA - Loan Disbursement → Wallet",
    "description": "Disbursement flow updated 2026-05-11.\n\n**Old flow (deprecated):** approved loan → IBAN bank transfer via middleware (HyperPay) → customer bank account.\n\n**New flow:** approved loan → Fineract deposit on customer's wallet savings account → balance immediately available in wallet.\n\nCall path:\n```\nLoanApplicationWorkflow Phase 6g\n  → DisbursementActivity.disburseToWallet(customerId, amount)\n  → wallet-service POST /internal/wallets/credit-from-loan  (X-Tenant-Id header)\n  → FineractSavingsPort.deposit(savingsId, amount, idemKey)\n  → wallet_db: balance += amount, movement row\n```\n\nThis collection covers:\n1. Login (customer JWT)\n2. Get my wallet balance BEFORE disbursement (JWT-based — no walletId needed)\n3. (Optional) Internal: directly credit a wallet (simulates what lending-service does)\n4. Get my wallet balance AFTER disbursement\n\nTenant: `00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001`\nRealm: `CompanyRealm`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "kongUrl", "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000", "description": "Kong gateway" },
    { "key": "walletBaseUrl", "value": "{{kongUrl}}/wallet-service", "description": "wallet-service via Kong" },
    { "key": "walletDirectUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8088", "description": "wallet-service direct (for /internal/** which Kong may not expose)" },
    { "key": "identityUrl", "value": "{{kongUrl}}/identity-service" },
    { "key": "jwt", "value": "", "description": "auto-set by login" },
    { "key": "tenantId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" },
    { "key": "nationalId", "value": "1010219431" },
    { "key": "pin", "value": "147852" },
    { "key": "customerId", "value": "", "description": "set this to the JWT customer_id/sub for /internal/credit-from-loan request body" },
    { "key": "loanId", "value": "", "description": "loan UUID, used as referenceId" },
    { "key": "amount", "value": "10000", "description": "disbursement amount in SAR" },
    { "key": "idempotencyKey", "value": "demo-disb-001", "description": "must be unique per disbursement; same key → returns DUPLICATE on retry" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{jwt}}" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login (auto-sets {{jwt}} and {{customerId}})",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const resp = pm.response.json();",
              "const data = resp.data || resp;",
              "if (data.accessToken) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt', data.accessToken);",
              "    const payload = JSON.parse(atob(data.accessToken.split('.')[1]));",
              "    const cust = payload.customer_id || payload.sub;",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('customerId', cust);",
              "    console.log('customerId:', cust);",
              "}",
              "pm.test('Login OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"nationalId\": \"{{nationalId}}\",\n  \"pin\": \"{{pin}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{identityUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login-with-pin",
        "description": "Login. JWT + customerId auto-saved into collection variables."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "1. GET /api/v1/wallets/me/balance  — BEFORE disbursement",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = body.data || body;",
              "console.log('Wallet:', d.walletNumber, '| Balance:', d.availableBalance, d.currency);",
              "console.log('Fineract savings ID:', d.fineractSavingsAccountId);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{walletBaseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/me/balance",
        "description": "NEW endpoint — resolves wallet from JWT `customer_id`/`sub` claim. No walletId in the URL. Fineract savings balance is fetched live."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. POST /internal/wallets/credit-from-loan  (simulates what lending-service does)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "console.log('Credited wallet:', r.walletNumber);",
              "console.log('Fineract txn id:', r.fineractTransactionId);",
              "console.log('New balance:', r.newAvailableBalance);",
              "console.log('Status:', r.status);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Tenant-Id", "value": "{{tenantId}}" },
          { "key": "X-Caller-Service", "value": "lending-service" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": \"{{customerId}}\",\n  \"amount\": {{amount}},\n  \"purpose\": \"LOAN_PROCEEDS\",\n  \"referenceType\": \"LOAN_DISBURSEMENT\",\n  \"referenceId\": \"{{loanId}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Loan disbursement (postman test)\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{idempotencyKey}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{walletDirectUrl}}/internal/wallets/credit-from-loan",
        "description": "INTERNAL endpoint — no JWT, uses `X-Tenant-Id` header.\n\nThis is exactly what `DisbursementActivityImpl.disburseToWallet()` calls inside `LoanApplicationWorkflow` Phase 6g after a loan is approved.\n\n**Idempotency**: re-running with the same `idempotencyKey` returns status `DUPLICATE` and does NOT credit again.\n\n**referenceId**: pass the loan UUID (lending-service does this automatically).\n\n**Note**: this endpoint runs on the wallet-service direct port (8088). Use Kong route if exposed publicly (depends on Kong config)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. GET /api/v1/wallets/me/balance  — AFTER disbursement",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = body.data || body;",
              "console.log('Wallet:', d.walletNumber, '| Balance:', d.availableBalance, d.currency);",
              "console.log('Balance should be old balance + {{amount}}');"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{walletBaseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/me/balance"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. GET /api/v1/wallets/me/balance  — idempotency check (re-credit same key)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Tenant-Id", "value": "{{tenantId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": \"{{customerId}}\",\n  \"amount\": {{amount}},\n  \"purpose\": \"LOAN_PROCEEDS\",\n  \"referenceType\": \"LOAN_DISBURSEMENT\",\n  \"referenceId\": \"{{loanId}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Loan disbursement (postman test)\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"{{idempotencyKey}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{walletDirectUrl}}/internal/wallets/credit-from-loan",
        "description": "Reusing the same idempotencyKey — server returns status=`DUPLICATE`, no second credit, balance unchanged. Verifies idempotency."
      }
    }
  ]
}
